{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "544fc42f-09b6-57b5-b5e7-99ebf872f3fc", "source_ordinal": 168, "reading_ordinal": 3890, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "肉闹钟", "published_at": "2026-05-04T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://www.ifdian.net/p/25b969d841a011f1a25d52540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这题目取得可够鸡贼的——啥东西和“过度”接起来有好果子吃？都用“过度”了，答案还不显然吗？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 45}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "问题在于，到底什么叫作“过度提醒”？", "char_start": 46, "char_end": 64}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "早上叫起床算过度提醒吗？晚上叫按时睡觉算过度提醒吗？房间一塌糊涂，要求收拾，算过度提醒吗？", "char_start": 65, "char_end": 110}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "过度的度在哪？", "char_start": 111, "char_end": 118}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "如果不提醒，早上不起床就要迟到、晚上不睡觉早上就起不了床，现实问题怎么办？不解决这些问题，单独地说“过度提醒有害”是没用的——上学迟到、旷课更有害，而且是“一会儿就有老师电话打过来”的有害。", "char_start": 119, "char_end": 214}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "不过度提醒，那么靠什么来调整孩子的行为？", "char_start": 215, "char_end": 235}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "首先，过度不过度的问题，看一条——最友善的陌生人会不会主动提醒。", "char_start": 236, "char_end": 268}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "凡是陌生人默认你会自己处理好的事情，ta们都不会提醒——例如ta们不会主动提醒你“还有半小时要开会，你是不是该出发了”，而是会假设你自然会准时，甚至会假设不经邀请而擅自提醒你是一种冒犯；ta们不会提醒你“中午要吃饭”，ta们会假设你到点要么自己会吃，要么就是不饿，要么就是有对你足够重要的事让你必须放弃午餐，没事去提醒一个成人要吃午饭也过度唐突。", "char_start": 269, "char_end": 442}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "但是有篮球朝你的方向飞去，ta们会大叫“当心”；对面有事故，ta们会向你挥手；自己这边有一个东西没弄好，混在合格品里面了，ta们会提醒你注意……", "char_start": 443, "char_end": 515}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "一件事算不算过度提醒，就要按照这个标准来考虑。原理倒也简单——父母的教导是引导你可以轻松的和友善的陌生人一起自如、愉快的生活，这个自然就是金标准。", "char_start": 516, "char_end": 589}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "而既然这是父母的职责，那么如果孩子可以不经持续的教导、反复的纠正，就在成年之前自觉的做到这一点，那就可以视作帮了父母的大忙，要按照帮了父母的忙来奖励。", "char_start": 590, "char_end": 665}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "这就是第二个问题的答案。", "char_start": 666, "char_end": 678}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "属于陌生人也会提醒你的事项，我作为父母也会承担这基本的职责，这属于社会成员要承担的义务，我们自然也要承担。", "char_start": 679, "char_end": 732}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "而你在未成年时应该达到可以不给友善的陌生人造成不规范的负担的程度，如果你提前完成了这项成就，你算是帮了我们的忙，我们会感谢你。", "char_start": 733, "char_end": 796}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "不但有态度上的感谢——即每次你不必经过提醒就做好18岁的人该做好的事，我们都会不厌其烦的表达赞赏和感谢，因为你减轻了我们的负担。甚至可以有物质的奖励，因为你减少了我们的焦虑。", "char_start": 797, "char_end": 884}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "而如果这些事情发展到了我们不得不提醒的地步，你倒也不会受到额外的责备，但是之前的那份感谢和奖励也就没有了。", "char_start": 885, "char_end": 938}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "不是责备和惩罚，而是之前的感激和奖励没有了。", "char_start": 939, "char_end": 961}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "不仅仅如此，原本你通过这些自觉的自我管理证明了你有足够的社会性，以至于可以得到相称的自由，现在也会因为你颠覆了这一点而有所回收。", "char_start": 962, "char_end": 1026}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "孩子的自驱力不是来自于父母的提醒，而是来自于成功免除父母提醒义务带来的自由和信任，来自这份“连续若干天不需要父母提醒主动处理好繁杂事务”“一年内触发提醒事件低于xx次”的自豪和与这自豪相关联的尊敬。", "char_start": 1027, "char_end": 1126}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "我们尊敬你，你说话的分量自然就重，你的意愿就自然更容易实现，你的自由自然就更大。", "char_start": 1127, "char_end": 1167}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "人类是自由的动物，没有什么孩子对父母的尊敬和自己的自由不上瘾的——尤其是自己在这两点上明显的胜过其他同学的时候。", "char_start": 1168, "char_end": 1224}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "其实之所以过度提醒会损害孩子的自驱力，原理恰好也是这个——过度提醒本质上是一种对人格健全程度的不信任票，本质上是一种隐性的侮辱，所以子女下意识的想要通过颓废、通过向你证明你的策略根本无效来惩罚你。", "char_start": 1225, "char_end": 1323}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "想明白了，用好这个思路就可以了。", "char_start": 1324, "char_end": 1340}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 24}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0555"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：家长过度提醒是否真的会损害孩子的自驱力？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023"], "summary": "围绕“肉闹钟”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这题目取得可够鸡贼的——啥东西和“过度”接起来有好果子吃？都用“过度”了，答案还不显然吗？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这题目取得可够鸡贼的——啥东西和“过度”接起来有好果子吃？都用“过度”了，答案还不显然吗？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 45, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "79f005aa-d531-5500-af2b-c0bf90c9af3f", "source_ordinal": 167, "reading_ordinal": 3891, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "右手出", "published_at": "2026-05-05T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://www.ifdian.net/p/d260d454425f11f1961452540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "你们有没有听说过“右手规则”？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 15}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "这是在电子游戏上古时代一种走迷宫的窍门——从入口开始，右手一直摸着墙壁，就总是可以走出无浮岛设计的迷宫——无论这个迷宫有多复杂都一样。", "char_start": 16, "char_end": 83}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "那个时候没有所谓的开放式世界，没有超大生成式地图。“游戏体验”全靠迷宫地图加随机遇敌——俗称“踩地雷”。", "char_start": 84, "char_end": 136}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "很多地图都很大，要是你不知道右手规则，一味的只知道乱走，如果没有小地图和游戏攻略，你很快就会陷入绝望。", "char_start": 137, "char_end": 188}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "在游戏中就是直接绝望，在真实的人生中，你就会愤怒。", "char_start": 189, "char_end": 214}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "因为在现实的生活中你会因为沮丧而砸墙，而且你有机会砸碎一两层，这会让你感觉愤怒似乎有一些用处。", "char_start": 215, "char_end": 262}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "然而世界的迷宫有无数道墙，一堵后面还有一堵。", "char_start": 263, "char_end": 285}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "无论你朝哪一面看，它们都层层叠叠延伸到天尽头。你甚至不确定朝着哪个方向砸会指向真正的彼岸。", "char_start": 286, "char_end": 331}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "你怎么知道你不是在奋力砸墙奔向地狱？", "char_start": 332, "char_end": 350}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "当你意识到这种战术上的努力在战略上的无效，你就不但会愤怒，还要怨恨。", "char_start": 351, "char_end": 385}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "怨恨墙，怨恨迷宫，怨恨渴望离开迷宫的自己，怨恨这整个设计。", "char_start": 386, "char_end": 415}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "而你真正缺少的，其实是那个“右手规则”。", "char_start": 416, "char_end": 436}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "“右手摸着墙，不要放开，一直走，无论道路有多么曲折，最后一定会到达终点。”", "char_start": 437, "char_end": 474}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "这一点，可以用数学在纸面上证明给你看。你明白了这信念的数学可靠性，就会因此平添近乎无限的耐心。", "char_start": 475, "char_end": 522}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "你就不慌了。不但不慌了，你甚至会在迷宫里流连忘返，尝试扫完这片迷宫的所有角落。", "char_start": 523, "char_end": 562}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "右手摸着墙，一道弯一道弯的走下去，你甚至会慢慢的意识到——其实游戏的设计者有考虑到你会用这个策略，所以迷宫也是对应着右手规则设计的。", "char_start": 563, "char_end": 629}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "你不需要知道整个迷宫的地图，只需要知道并相信这个简单的法则就足够了。它非常的简洁，然而却极为有力，足以让你安下心来，享受旅程。", "char_start": 630, "char_end": 693}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "在人生的早期，还没有找到自己的右手法则，却已经开始在迷宫中碰壁，就是青少年愤怒、怨恨的根源。", "char_start": 694, "char_end": 740}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "这是一个难以避免的人生阶段，非得花上几年工夫去失望和迷茫不可。", "char_start": 741, "char_end": 772}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "尤其是这个巨变的时代，互联网、5G、短视频革命、疫情、贸易战、人工智能，不断的把人类拉进前所未有的局面，很多新的区域毫无地图，父母也不知道方向何在，人类的迷茫是空前的。因此这一代的年轻人客观上面临的挑战也是前所未有的困难，挫折感积累深了，愤怒和怨恨怎么能免得了呢？", "char_start": 773, "char_end": 905}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "正因为如此，找到个人能够寄托信念的方法论体系才对保持乐观和镇定，持续作出正面努力，获得有效积淀有至关重要的作用。", "char_start": 906, "char_end": 962}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "你要找到你的“右手规则”，这才是你安静下来的最终出路。", "char_start": 963, "char_end": 990}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "慢慢来吧，不要着急。", "char_start": 991, "char_end": 1001}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "和我们一起慢慢找，你会找到的。", "char_start": 1002, "char_end": 1017}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 25}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0555"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么这代孩子心中会压抑着那么多的愤怒、怨恨？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024"], "summary": "围绕“右手出”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“你们有没有听说过“右手规则”？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "你们有没有听说过“右手规则”？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 15, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "85a7fc1a-bf16-586c-a471-b5aa3d72e4e2", "source_ordinal": 166, "reading_ordinal": 3892, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "共情剑", "published_at": "2026-05-05T23:22:14.196000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/1937311008227063680/answer/2032163854940160146"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这里面存在一个悖论。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 10}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "他喜欢你什么？", "char_start": 11, "char_end": 18}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "如果他喜欢你是因为你的优秀，那么在他眼里你的原生家庭就算糟糕也不会是一无是处，因为你毕竟是它的直接产物，是靠着家庭供养教育出来的。", "char_start": 19, "char_end": 84}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "如果他喜欢的是你的残破、失败——这会让你变得特别依赖、崇拜和顺从，从而特别容易满足对方的偶像欲望——那么他倒是会同意你的原生家庭是罪恶的渊薮，否则你也不会成为这个样子，但是这时候你得先想清楚这该不该是你们的主要关系纽带。", "char_start": 85, "char_end": 195}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "你得想想清楚你要的是什么。", "char_start": 196, "char_end": 209}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "对方自居你的阳光和空气，成为你未曾有过的幻想中的父亲、兄长，在一开始会让你感到巨大的缺憾补足。但是用不了多久你就会发现，小太阳毕竟不是真太阳，是要用电费的。", "char_start": 210, "char_end": 288}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "电费也许不会找你收，但是“节约用电”的要求可以转化为“门不要老开着”“不要动不动就开窗换气”“被子盖厚点，不要总想着靠取暖器”等等复杂的要求。", "char_start": 289, "char_end": 360}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "将来你未必会喜欢那个共情你对原生家庭的控诉的人。", "char_start": 361, "char_end": 385}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "而且，有个巨大而典型的悲剧，是曾经无比共情的小太阳将来某一天筋疲力竭、发不动电时，很容易——真的是很容易——说出一句能让你肝胆俱裂的话：", "char_start": 386, "char_end": 454}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "“我现在明白你家里人为什么这样对你了。”", "char_start": 455, "char_end": 475}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "看着这把共情剑，你就会知道人长着心是一件多么痛苦的事。", "char_start": 476, "char_end": 503}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "我真不想你知道这个。", "char_start": 504, "char_end": 514}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "相信我，你也不想知道。", "char_start": 515, "char_end": 526}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 14}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0555"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：跟男朋友诉说原生家庭的痛苦后，男朋友觉得我不懂的感恩、不知足怎么办?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013"], "summary": "围绕“共情剑”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这里面存在一个悖论。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这里面存在一个悖论。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 10, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "171a8ff5-4f98-5575-849e-46da57be1d50", "source_ordinal": 165, "reading_ordinal": 3893, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "伤绳", "published_at": "2026-05-05T23:24:12.088000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/1946636394383515889/answer/2032393124841006935"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "quote", "index": 1, "text": "我们开着一家修理店，今年开始，每年存款大概10万吧。我们目前有积蓄不到30万。我们前年买了房子，在镇上，花了40万。因为我们当时没有住的地方。这是一个非常不明智的决定。尤其今天儿子在学校和同学打架，班主任处理之后，打电话给我，下面是我简洁整理出来的通话记录：班主任：“你儿子的情况和他现在掌握的认知，你有没有觉得在乡镇是一种浪费？我的意思是如果是我的孩子我不会把放在这样一个环境里。”我：“我有考虑过，但是现实因素客观存在……方便问一下您孩子多大了呢？”班主任：“他还很小，但是我也很纠结应该送他去哪里上学，因为我们家住在城乡结合部，如果在家里上学的话，环境很糟糕，如果在城市里面，我又担心会不会压力", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 891, "sample_truncated": true}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "非常不建议你这么做。", "char_start": 892, "char_end": 902}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "一个很大的原因就是你这么做会严重影响家庭经济稳定性，而家庭经济稳定性对父母、子女的精神发育有很大的影响。", "char_start": 903, "char_end": 955}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "你的积蓄是30万的时候你是一个想法，50万是另一个想法，100万又是一个想法。然而你要在积蓄30万、年盈余10万的时候，想着转向将30万积蓄消耗相当部分，并且折损年盈余10万的现金流。", "char_start": 956, "char_end": 1048}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "你这个决定在财务上是非常昂贵的。", "char_start": 1049, "char_end": 1065}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "积蓄30万，年增10万的人的精神状态和积蓄10万，年盈余3万的甚至可以打平——你走了，现金收入大幅下降但支出却大幅上升，这是很可能发生的，那时你的整个精神状态会发生巨大的转变。", "char_start": 1066, "char_end": 1154}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "可以这么说——你现在会动这个念头，和这个“30万积蓄、10万盈余”带给你的安全感有直接关系。然而你这个念头一执行下去，这个支撑你作出这决定的精神基础就会消失。", "char_start": 1155, "char_end": 1234}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这就像你抓住一根绳子往上爬，这根绳子的存在就是你往上爬的支撑，然而你爬高之后的第一件事就是把这根绳子割断一半。", "char_start": 1235, "char_end": 1290}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "你吊得更高，然而绳子却更细了，你的心态会发生巨大的变化。", "char_start": 1291, "char_end": 1319}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "你原本在有绳子可拉的时候所拥有的乐观，都会随着绳子变细而消失。", "char_start": 1320, "char_end": 1351}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "此刻兵强马壮的你下的决心，如果让之后人困马乏的你再做，你很难再投赞成票——这其实就是后悔的数学公式。", "char_start": 1352, "char_end": 1402}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "这必然意味着悔恨和迷茫、意味着强烈的自我怀疑和情绪折磨。而这些东西一旦对作息、饮食形成伤害，人会陷入负面循环而不断的下沉。", "char_start": 1403, "char_end": 1464}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "除非孩子在新环境里捷报频传，否则ta哪怕只是维持原状，都会导致付出了巨大代价、处境变得薄弱艰难的你产生很大的负面情绪。", "char_start": 1465, "char_end": 1524}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "那时的你对孩子很难再保持之前的理解和宽容，给孩子的容错性会大幅的削弱。", "char_start": 1525, "char_end": 1560}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "孩子现在还不理解这份容错性有多重要，你也还没意识到。", "char_start": 1561, "char_end": 1587}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "事实上，这份由自身安全带来的容错性是子女养成健康人格最重要的资产之一。没有它，子女根本没有做个人探索的空间，会被焦虑父母抓着手学开车。犯任何一点错误都会招来父母的过度反应，最后会形成激烈的亲子矛盾。", "char_start": 1588, "char_end": 1687}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "虽然时代几乎注定这代人绝大部分都要经历抑郁的洗礼，但在经受这洗礼时，父母不是站在自己身后，而是站在自己对面，终究也是一个糟糕的安排。", "char_start": 1688, "char_end": 1754}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "父母们要投资子女的未来，追求更好的条件，这可以。但这一定要建立在几乎不会影响家庭财富增长的主要趋势的大前提下。", "char_start": 1755, "char_end": 1810}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "不要觉得自己似乎为了保住积蓄、保持每月有足够盈余而不追求“更高的条件”是“没有尽力”，这是一个极端错误的思想。", "char_start": 1811, "char_end": 1866}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "这就像一个人在为自己每天不是工作、学习到直接晕倒，于是觉得自己“没有尽力”一样，是一种愚蠢的会计逻辑。按这个“尽力”标准，三五个月你人就要大病一场，赶出来什么进度也全要吐回去，还要倒找。", "char_start": 1867, "char_end": 1960}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "你有足够应对意外风险的积蓄、有足够你对未来抱有积极信心的盈余，你才会有健康宽容的心，亲切的笑容，有在子女遇到问题时抱抱ta，说句“没关系，下次注意就好”的能量，你的子女才能在这个基础上建立起对一切挫折和失败最终必然胜利的信心和耐心。", "char_start": 1961, "char_end": 2077}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "有这个最基本的乐观护心，ta的“起点低”在ta的“航程长”“动力强”“方向稳”面前根本不成其为问题。", "char_start": 2078, "char_end": 2128}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "尽力是对的，但舍弃这个最关键的战略资产，搞涸泽而渔的财务冒险去“托举”孩子，这是得不偿失的，这不叫“尽力”。", "char_start": 2129, "char_end": 2183}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "如果你久经风雨，多次东山再起，心理能量很强，那么这事你可以把安全线压得比常人低一点。但如果你是一个七大姑八大姨、路人甲路人乙嘀咕几句就会对人生规划发生重大动摇的人，万万不要高估财务威胁对你自己心态平衡的冲击，最好谦和一点。", "char_start": 2184, "char_end": 2295}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "你要冷静的告诉自己，这个程度就是尽力了——宁可父母抱着足量的安全感去支撑子女应对现有环境下的种种人际关系挑战，也不要父母耗巨资帮子女“换战场”。", "char_start": 2296, "char_end": 2368}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "新环境一样会有问题，但那时你们弹尽粮绝了，很可能只能被动挨打，甚至自身都从友军变成问题。", "char_start": 2369, "char_end": 2413}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "算账一定要算总账，这一点关节，父母们一定要心里有数。", "char_start": 2414, "char_end": 2440}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"quote": 1, "paragraph": 27}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0555"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：按我们家现有的条件，孩子应该留在乡镇还是转去城市？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027"], "summary": "围绕“伤绳”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“我们开着一家修理店，今年开始，每年存款大概10万吧。我们目前有积蓄不到30万。我们前年买了房子，在镇上，花了40万。因为我们当时没有住的地方。这是一个非常不明智的决定。尤其今天儿子在学校和同学打架，班主任处理之后，打电话给我，下面是我简洁整理出来的通话记录：班主任：“你儿子的情况和他现在掌握的认知，你有没有觉得在乡镇是一种浪费？我的意思是如果是我的孩子我不会”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "quote", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "我们开着一家修理店，今年开始，每年存款大概10万吧。我们目前有积蓄不到30万。我们前年买了房子，在镇上，花了40万。因为我们当时没有住的地方。这是一个非常不明智的决定。尤其今天儿子在学校和同学打架，班主任处理之后，打电话给我，下面是我简洁整理出来的通话记录：班主任：“你儿子的情况和他现在掌握的认知，你有没有觉得在乡镇是一种浪费？我的意思是如果是我的孩子我不会", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 891, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "4785488c-ee5e-5dc5-ab82-dc075fe56891", "source_ordinal": 164, "reading_ordinal": 3894, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "单", "published_at": "2026-05-07T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://www.ifdian.net/p/b23a399a440311f180bf52540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "“自愿独身”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 7}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "“自愿”。", "char_start": 8, "char_end": 13}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "人类是可能“自愿独身”的动物吗？", "char_start": 14, "char_end": 30}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "一个个的，都是在无数的尝试之中知道了这件事的要求有多难，然后对遇到真的能做到的人绝望了，没有更多的能量再经历一轮期待了。", "char_start": 31, "char_end": 91}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "甚至，说“知道了这事到底有多难”都太夸张了。", "char_start": 92, "char_end": 114}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "其实不知道——自己都不知道对方到底要好到什么样，自己才能甘心、才能满意。", "char_start": 115, "char_end": 151}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "只是知道哪怕是优秀到前任这个样子，仍然远远的没有及格。", "char_start": 152, "char_end": 179}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "而前任虽然可恨，但也已经很优秀了。", "char_start": 180, "char_end": 197}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "那么优秀，当初那么令我倾倒，我当初是那么的爱他，这么好的起点、这么理想的条件，却仍然是一地鸡毛。", "char_start": 198, "char_end": 246}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "我要到哪里去找比这更好的人呢？", "char_start": 247, "char_end": 262}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "找到了，我又拿什么去给他呢？", "char_start": 263, "char_end": 277}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "我不想单身。", "char_start": 278, "char_end": 284}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "我真的不想。", "char_start": 285, "char_end": 291}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "我怕黑，怕寂寞，怕孤立无援，怕老无所依……", "char_start": 292, "char_end": 313}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "但我不敢相信我还有这么好的运气了。", "char_start": 314, "char_end": 331}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "我哪有“自愿”？", "char_start": 332, "char_end": 340}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "我只是没有力气了。", "char_start": 341, "char_end": 350}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "我不自愿，又能如何呢？", "char_start": 351, "char_end": 362}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "我不漂亮、也不富有，敏感又多疑，执拗又脆弱，我自己都觉得自己很讨厌，自己都觉得自己太难取悦。", "char_start": 363, "char_end": 409}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "设身处地的想，我想不到任何值得乐观的理由。", "char_start": 410, "char_end": 431}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "不，你别安慰我，真的。我这不是在自我贬低，一点也没有。", "char_start": 432, "char_end": 459}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "而是过去种种，由不得我不承认，我真的就是这样。", "char_start": 460, "char_end": 483}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "能救我的，我配不上。我既然配不上，对方就算真的瞎了眼来对我好，我只会一天比一天忧虑欠人太多，怕还不起。", "char_start": 484, "char_end": 535}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "怕还不起，却习惯了你的好；怕要在已经习惯了你的好的时候，眼睁睁的看着你因失望而离开。", "char_start": 536, "char_end": 578}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "我却开不了口挽留，因为我知道自己罪有应得。", "char_start": 579, "char_end": 600}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "可笑吧，说到这里我的心居然还在痛。", "char_start": 601, "char_end": 618}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "我以为上次碎过之后它已经没了。", "char_start": 619, "char_end": 634}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "我明明没有再把它拼起来了，为什么还会痛。", "char_start": 635, "char_end": 655}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "亲爱的，这就是为什么我要“自愿”拒绝你的表白。", "char_start": 656, "char_end": 679}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "别误会，我不是怀疑你的真诚。", "char_start": 680, "char_end": 694}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "我相信你是真心的，我也相信你是真的喜欢我。", "char_start": 695, "char_end": 716}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "我只是知道故事的结局，所以“自愿”想要省了这一轮苦楚罢了。", "char_start": 717, "char_end": 746}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "如果我是二十多岁，还有那美好的肉体和没有碎裂的心，至少让你不至于一无所得，我也许会捂住眼睛再和你赌一次。", "char_start": 747, "char_end": 799}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "但我没有。", "char_start": 800, "char_end": 805}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "没有就是没有。", "char_start": 806, "char_end": 813}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "这就是我单着、并且可能也只能一直单下去的原因。", "char_start": 814, "char_end": 837}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "不干“独立”“觉醒”什么事。", "char_start": 838, "char_end": 852}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "————", "char_start": 853, "char_end": 857}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "你们别怕，", "char_start": 858, "char_end": 863}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "也别难过。", "char_start": 864, "char_end": 869}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "写这些不是为了让你们重温这些痛苦，", "char_start": 870, "char_end": 887}, {"paragraph_id": "P042", "field": "body", "index": 42, "text": "而是告诉你们，我知道。", "char_start": 888, "char_end": 899}, {"paragraph_id": "P043", "field": "body", "index": 43, "text": "这份痛苦正是这些文字存在的原因——它知道它要解决的是什么。", "char_start": 900, "char_end": 929}, {"paragraph_id": "P044", "field": "body", "index": 44, "text": "爱不是这样的东西，", "char_start": 930, "char_end": 939}, {"paragraph_id": "P045", "field": "body", "index": 45, "text": "别绝望。", "char_start": 940, "char_end": 944}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 46}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0555"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：部分女性选择自愿独身、不结婚，是因为中国女性独立觉醒了吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041", "P042", "P043", "P044", "P045"], "summary": "围绕“单”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：““自愿独身”。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "“自愿独身”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 7, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "ef1a7859-eb5a-5db5-be19-408e0c03abb9", "source_ordinal": 163, "reading_ordinal": 3895, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "湖心岛", "published_at": "2026-05-08T13:38:09.179000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/36257657/answer/2036077305114702649"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "quote", "index": 1, "text": "举例：\n1. A花了3年学习金融，但是并不是他的喜好，他不愿意换专业的理由为：我已经花了3年的时间学习会计，难道我要浪费掉这三年吗？\n2. 情侣谈恋爱了，却发现对方一直不合适可是不分手，因为已经花了这么多时间互相磨合。\n可是这些是已经支付的成本，已经没有可能拿回来的成本，可是为什么我们作为凡人总是念念不忘？\n\n引用下百度百科：\n‘沉没成本是指由于过去的决策已经发生了的，而不能由现在或将来的任何决策改变的成本。人们在决定是否去做一件事情的时候，不仅是看这件事对自己有没有好处，而且也看过去是不是已经在这件事情上有过投入。我们把这些已经发生不可收回的支出，如时间、金钱、精力等称为“沉没成本”（Sun", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 389, "sample_truncated": true}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "这个问题啊，真的要捂嘴笑。", "char_start": 390, "char_end": 403}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "因为西方人和中国人对“沉没”的理解是不一样的。", "char_start": 404, "char_end": 427}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "西方人的“沉没”，那是在海上沉的。", "char_start": 428, "char_end": 445}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "那是sunk in the sea。", "char_start": 446, "char_end": 464}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "水深最少三十米，那还是近海。", "char_start": 465, "char_end": 479}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "远海水都是黑的，水深轻松三百米，掉座山进去都露不了头，那是真没得打捞了。", "char_start": 480, "char_end": 516}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "中国人呢，沉没都是沉在池塘里、湖里、江里。", "char_start": 517, "char_end": 538}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "水深3-10米，跳进水里踩在桅杆尖上，人半截都在水面上。", "char_start": 539, "char_end": 567}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "我拿土布袋丢湖里，堆到3米了，是还没露出水面。", "char_start": 568, "char_end": 591}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "但是我要咬咬牙继续堆下去，再运两车来，就可能堆出水面。", "char_start": 592, "char_end": 619}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "狠狠心堆出一个湖心岛，可以住人。", "char_start": 620, "char_end": 636}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "于是，只有我停止追加投资，彻底放弃项目，之前的投入才会真的沉没。", "char_start": 637, "char_end": 669}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "我不放弃，它就只是“前期投入”“必不可少的基础建设”罢了。", "char_start": 670, "char_end": 699}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "这就是沉在湖里和沉在海里的区别。", "char_start": 700, "char_end": 716}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "沉在海里是真沉没，沉在湖里却是假沉没。", "char_start": 717, "char_end": 736}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "面对真沉没，没人会真犹豫——钥匙掉海里了，谁还会去捞呢？", "char_start": 737, "char_end": 765}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "但是面对假沉没，人想的是“我不半途而废，自有起死回生”。", "char_start": 766, "char_end": 794}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "我们是大陆民族，相信的是力气到了，愚公能移山，子子孙孙无穷匮也，事在人为。", "char_start": 795, "char_end": 832}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "只有“为山九仞，功亏一篑”的教训，哪有什么任其沉没的懦弱道理？", "char_start": 833, "char_end": 864}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "所以我们几乎没有沉没成本的直观概念，只有“岂能半途而废”的自我激励和水滴石穿的信念。", "char_start": 865, "char_end": 907}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "海洋民族“一次暴风雨死半船人”的事见得多了，沉了就是真沉了。", "char_start": 908, "char_end": 938}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "与其哭泣，不如早点上岸报保险。", "char_start": 939, "char_end": 954}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"quote": 1, "paragraph": 22}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0555"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么人总是念念不忘沉没成本（sunk cost）？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023"], "summary": "围绕“湖心岛”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“举例：”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "quote", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "举例：", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 389, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "40b0dd59-e215-5ead-add2-344095509b60", "source_ordinal": 159, "reading_ordinal": 3896, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "桃花庵里桃花仙", "published_at": "2026-05-08T19:00:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/2004938442837092198/answer/2025598976171282930"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "事实上，AI潮流最微妙的一点，就是最后摘果子的将不会是程序员们，而会是原本几乎不太懂技术的实业界用户。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 51}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "例如一名种桃子的农民。", "char_start": 52, "char_end": 63}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这人以前只能把产品卖给集中采购商，因为这位集中采购商依靠资本优势集中了智力资源，通过IT技术优势和由此优势衍生出来的流量优势占据了整个商业流程的主要部分，卡在了桃农和ta的用户之间。", "char_start": 64, "char_end": 155}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "而AI最大的作用，就是会趋向从最终意义上消灭这个“智力优势”。", "char_start": 156, "char_end": 187}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "桃农拿出自己的桃子，告诉AI：“帮我卖出去”。", "char_start": 188, "char_end": 211}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "AI开始生成商业计划——它将预约抽检和分级服务，将桃子分为三类产品：甜度品相最好的，它会生成介绍站点和营销内容，寻找适当的平台开始投放它生成的广告短片，开始对外销售；品质优良但卖相欠佳的，AI将定制罐头服务和酿造服务，做成独有的罐头和酒类产品；再次一等的，AI挂牌卖给饲料和绿色生物材料企业回收利用。", "char_start": 212, "char_end": 362}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "桃农唯一需要解决的，就是批准计划并支付资金。中间的所有环节都会在一个不太长的时间段落内，被各种纯程序员们开办的OPC以极度的竞争相互湮灭，成为AI可以直接调用的平台服务。", "char_start": 363, "char_end": 448}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "最完美的服务会被各家大模型企业推出的竞品夺魂而去——它们将直接拒绝为你的个人优秀产品提供服务，然后推出和它们的闭源模型深度整合的成熟产品。", "char_start": 449, "char_end": 518}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "最后活下来的，只有巨头企业和桃农、包装商、冷库服务商、冷链运输商、罐装服务商、酿造服务商。", "char_start": 519, "char_end": 564}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "ta们的共同特点，就是都占用着真实运转着的机器，处理着现实的物理、化学过程。", "char_start": 565, "char_end": 603}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "没有垄断任何物理性资源或者内容源头的程序员们会发现自己就像孙中山，如果不开黄埔军校、不掌握自己的武装，总想依靠巧妙的利用军阀来治平天下，最后总是在为军阀作嫁衣，到底一场空。", "char_start": 604, "char_end": 690}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "现在在为AI的进步欢呼的是程序员们，", "char_start": 691, "char_end": 709}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "但AI时代最后的赢家却会是桃农们。", "char_start": 710, "char_end": 727}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "如果你唯一的优势就是比你种桃子的舅舅更懂敲键盘，你可能在五年后发现是他不再需要你，而不是你将淘汰他。", "char_start": 728, "char_end": 778}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "是你应该早点去跟他学一点种桃子。", "char_start": 779, "char_end": 795}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "我的判断一般会领先现实三年到五年，你还有时间找到你的“桃子”。", "char_start": 796, "char_end": 827}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "别花太多时间追逐最新的AI技术，开始种你的桃子。", "char_start": 828, "char_end": 852}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 17}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0555"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：你看好超级个体，一人公司（OPC）吗？为什么？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017"], "summary": "围绕“桃花庵里桃花仙”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“事实上，AI潮流最微妙的一点，就是最后摘果子的将不会是程序员们，而会是原本几乎不太懂技术的实业界用户。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "事实上，AI潮流最微妙的一点，就是最后摘果子的将不会是程序员们，而会是原本几乎不太懂技术的实业界用户。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 51, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "7d2a60f5-fbf5-56b4-9971-72521ef6c046", "source_ordinal": 160, "reading_ordinal": 3897, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "柳下会", "published_at": "2026-05-08T19:00:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/1974500863881021009/answer/2025940723179037957"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "1）要早点开始，没有包袱、没有顾忌的开始。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 21}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "很多人会觉得自己不是什么帅哥美女、不是大师专家、不是行业精英，觉得自己一无是处 ，所以要躲起来，要等到自己身上有什么值得人羡慕和崇拜的东西了才想尝试。", "char_start": 22, "char_end": 97}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这是错的。", "char_start": 98, "char_end": 103}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "不是只有偶像才配被看到。", "char_start": 104, "char_end": 116}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "人们愿意花时间，也不是为了来各种偶像崇拜。", "char_start": 117, "char_end": 138}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "人要找的第一目标是爱。", "char_start": 139, "char_end": 150}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "heading", "index": 7, "text": "是无欲无求，寻求同乐的爱。", "char_start": 151, "char_end": 164}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "只要你不掠夺什么，而是真的在分享，你分享的东西再卑微也不是问题。", "char_start": 165, "char_end": 197}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "一片小小的风景。一朵形状有趣的乌云。一颗刚长出来的竹笋。一群往回搬馒头的蚂蚁。你大扫除翻出来的小时候自己画的漫画。", "char_start": 198, "char_end": 255}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "任何让你高兴起来，你也觉得可以让你的朋友们高兴起来的东西，自自然然就会有力量，随时随地成为“爆款”。", "char_start": 256, "char_end": 306}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "你根本没有必要等到自己牛起来、伟大起来再行动，你现在就可以行动起来。", "char_start": 307, "char_end": 341}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "而且我劝你要早一点开始，因为也许是天意——AI到来之后，一切的所谓专业技能，若没有被时间证明的爱作保，都恐怕要面临困境。而唯一能为爱作保的，其实只有时间。", "char_start": 342, "char_end": 419}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "无心插柳，五年成荫。", "char_start": 420, "char_end": 430}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "到时候这“柳下会”很可能会成为你一生最重要的财富。", "char_start": 431, "char_end": 456}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "前提是你【现在】就要开始栽种。", "char_start": 457, "char_end": 472}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "2）你必须保持轻松。", "char_start": 474, "char_end": 484}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "不要想着一上来搞得非常“专业”，又是片头、又是运镜，又是写稿，又是表情管理、灯光、化妆……", "char_start": 485, "char_end": 530}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "不要这样。", "char_start": 531, "char_end": 536}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "拿个手机一架，说你心中所感所想，别想那么多。", "char_start": 537, "char_end": 559}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "你一定要轻松，这事一定不能对你成为任何意义上的负担。", "char_start": 560, "char_end": 586}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "一定要反过来——做这件事之后你的心情会比做之前要好。", "char_start": 587, "char_end": 613}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "这事本身就要对你存在享受，带来抚慰和滋养。", "char_start": 614, "char_end": 635}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "最轻的负担不是0，而是+1。", "char_start": 636, "char_end": 650}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "要找到“按这个标准，我每天干一干都没啥问题”的感觉，按照这个感觉去干。", "char_start": 651, "char_end": 686}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "所以你不要摆架子，不要锣鼓喧天，不要兴师动众，不要“勇于投入”，更不要“孤注一掷”。", "char_start": 687, "char_end": 729}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "是它本身就应该带给你力量和舒缓，而不是你先把自己搞得苦哈哈，然后指望它来给你“应有的回报”。", "char_start": 730, "char_end": 776}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "heading", "index": 27, "text": "否则你一定会渐渐憎恨你自己请来的客人，最后这事必死无疑。", "char_start": 777, "char_end": 805}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "3）多做好事，尤其是没有争议的好事，令饥者得食，寒者得衣，病者得治，孤苦者得依的好事。", "char_start": 807, "char_end": 850}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "这不是要你表演给别人看，搞广而告之——如果你实际所做的不比人所知道的多得多，那是不健康的。", "char_start": 851, "char_end": 896}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "这不但是提醒你自己保持初衷的必要功课，也是将来有一天各种风波涌动时保证你自己不迷茫的定锚。", "char_start": 897, "char_end": 942}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "你一旦有些成就，万千毁谤会无法避免的席卷而来。你为人所知的那些善行是天然的防波堤，而你不为人知的那些则是你内心的定海石。", "char_start": 943, "char_end": 1003}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "ta们并不如你知道你自己，而ta们不知道的那些让ta们的“批评”变得毫无意义。这是极其要紧的功课，切切不可轻忽。", "char_start": 1004, "char_end": 1060}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "除了这三条，其它的什么风格、什么定位、什么题材、什么手法……都是次要的，都自然会在长期愉快、健康的实践中找到答案，会被这三条解决。", "char_start": 1062, "char_end": 1127}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "这个世界上，一切都可能饱和，爱不会饱和。", "char_start": 1128, "char_end": 1148}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "一切都可以取消，爱不会取消。", "char_start": 1149, "char_end": 1163}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "好好地去爱你素未谋面的朋友们，什么也不要担心。", "char_start": 1164, "char_end": 1187}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 37, "heading": 2}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0555"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：我想做自媒体能不能给我几条建议？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036"], "summary": "围绕“柳下会”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“1）要早点开始，没有包袱、没有顾忌的开始。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "1）要早点开始，没有包袱、没有顾忌的开始。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 21, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
